    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "EA9DF8A57A95E017",
      "text": "好了好了！站住！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "C01FE0B0C3FE6700",
      "text": "這前面是我們\\n天星隊惡幫班……\\r\\n通稱閣道二小隊的基地。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "EA9DF9A57A95E1CA",
      "text": "沒錯～所以別搞什麼擅自入侵，\\n饒了我們吧！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_02",
      "hash64": "C01FE3B0C3FE6C19",
      "text": "抱歉啊。如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不離開的話，\\n我們就得把[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳趕走。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "EA9DFAA57A95E37D",
      "text": "咦～該不會……\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]？[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_04",
      "hash64": "EA9DF3A57A95D798",
      "text": "就是那個向天星隊挑釁，\\n現在被通緝中的傢伙？[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8681C990FFF42607",
      "text": "或許是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8681CA90FFF427BA",
      "text": "才不是！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_03",
      "hash64": "C01FE2B0C3FE6A66",
      "text": "欸，或許是……？\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這麼老實反而嚇到我了。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_04",
      "hash64": "C01FE5B0C3FE6F7F",
      "text": "正是被通緝中的傢伙，\\n才會強調自己不是那個人……！[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "EA9DF4A57A95D94B",
      "text": "不管[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是何方神聖，快閃一邊去！\\n不然就等著輸給我吧！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "8681CB90FFF4296D",
      "text": "我會贏的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "8681C490FFF41D88",
      "text": "我現在就走……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_05",
      "hash64": "C01FE4B0C3FE6DCC",
      "text": "那[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就趕快走吧。\\n今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_06",
      "hash64": "EA9DF5A57A95DAFE",
      "text": "啥！真是囂張的傢伙！\\n看我痛扁[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嚐嚐我的厲害！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_07",
      "hash64": "EA9DF6A57A95DCB1",
      "text": "啊～！太不甘心了～！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_08",
      "hash64": "EA9DEFA57A95D0CC",
      "text": "接下來就拜託前輩了！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_a_09",
      "hash64": "EA9DF0A57A95D27F",
      "text": "那今天星苦了～！[VAR 0x0114(002D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_06",
      "hash64": "C01FE7B0C3FE72E5",
      "text": "今天星苦了……[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_07",
      "hash64": "C01FE6B0C3FE7132",
      "text": "…………[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_08",
      "hash64": "C01FE9B0C3FE764B",
      "text": "她是最近剛加入的成員，\\n態度實在是很差……[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_09",
      "hash64": "C01FE8B0C3FE7498",
      "text": "……唉。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_10",
      "hash64": "C01C7BB0C3FB858A",
      "text": "我現在要回去基地\\n通知其他的夥伴。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_010_sitappa_b_11",
      "hash64": "C01C7CB0C3FB873D",
      "text": "我們會全員出動來攻擊[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的。\\n所以不管[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是要逃要戰，總之加油吧。[VAR 0x0114(002E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
